<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting us regarding your experience in {DEPARTURE}&nbsp;on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.</p>

<p>I'm sorry we were unable to carry you on flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} and the impact it's had on your plans. We take the utmost care in managing each flight, but on rare occasions a flight may be overbooked.<br />
<br />
If this happens, we'll always do our best to find you an alternative flight. However, if the options available aren't suitable and you no longer wish to travel, we will provide a full refund.</p>

<p><b><i>If QF issued ticket add:</i></b><br />
<br />
<strong>Flight Refunded</strong><br />
I've checked with our ticketing team and confirmed that a refund of <strong>&lt;$00.00&gt;</strong> AUD has now been processed back to the original form of payment.<br />
<br />
<b><i>If agent/other airline ticket add:</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Contact your travel service provider</strong><br />
As your flight was booked through <em><strong>&lt;insert name of travel agent/website/airline&gt;</strong></em> rather than Qantas directly, you'll need to contact your agent to process your refund.</p>

<p><b><i>If requesting compensation and customer isn't entitled to compensation under our Compensation and Refunds Policy, add:</i></b></p>

<p><strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
If you had any unexpected expenses because of this cancellation, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations. Please let me know if you'd like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claims.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important part in our continuous improvement process, so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with us.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that your feedback has been shared with the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>